  "title": "Pork, Broccoli and Rice Casserole",
  "description": "I made this pork and broccoli dish one night when I had leftover pork roast cooked in my slow cooker and frozen. Pork, broccoli, and rice with a hint of curry. It&#39;s very homey and easy to make ahead of time.",
